    <description>WDC 65816 (SNES main CPU); decode table and M/X width context vendored from joshleaves/ghidra-snes -- disassembly is sound, but immediate operands are modelled as memory reads rather than constants and the p-code semantics are unverified (beads grm-9nxj.2, grm-9nxj.4)</description>
